# 0.4.0 step 4: a cold return in print mode (no away timer) whose plan wants a summary that is not ready goes with nothing (the
# 150K answer is prose, not foldable) and produces it in the background; the first turn_end valve after it is ready takes it,
# priced as ready (its call spent). TR's restated clause; the mutant prices it again and leaves the context at 155K.
world explicit known ttl=300 true=300 survival=none c=1 sys=3000 window=200000 native print
prompt
say 150K
prompt +1h
call npm 100
call npm 100
say 100
prompt +1h
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
say 100
